1
00:00:03,082 --> 00:00:06,992
Mila blows, and bubbles fly everywhere, all perfectly round!

2
00:00:07,042 --> 00:00:09,236
So Noah tries with a square frame…

3
00:00:09,286 --> 00:00:10,870
and they're still round!

4
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:15,484
Square, triangle, star: whatever the shape of the frame,

5
00:00:15,534 --> 00:00:17,986
the bubble always ends up as a ball.

6
00:00:18,036 --> 00:00:18,593
But why?

7
00:00:19,372 --> 00:00:20,886
Discovery mission!

8
00:00:23,402 --> 00:00:24,070
Mini mode!

9
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:27,232
A bubble is a very thin skin of soapy water,

10
00:00:27,282 --> 00:00:28,094
full of air.

11
00:00:28,144 --> 00:00:31,184
This skin is stretched: it pulls to shrink,

12
00:00:31,234 --> 00:00:32,959
like a blown-up balloon.

13
00:00:33,742 --> 00:00:35,008
But the air inside stops

14
00:00:35,058 --> 00:00:36,487
it from shrinking too much.

15
00:00:36,537 --> 00:00:40,160
So the skin picks the shape that needs the least skin for that air:

16
00:00:40,210 --> 00:00:40,703
the ball!

17
00:00:42,741 --> 00:00:44,972
And when two bubbles stick together,

18
00:00:45,022 --> 00:00:47,442
they share a flat wall: even less skin!

19
00:00:47,492 --> 00:00:49,406
But if the skin dries or tears…

20
00:00:49,456 --> 00:00:50,343
pop, all gone.

21
00:00:51,138 --> 00:00:53,963
On a wet hand, the bubble holds without popping,

22
00:00:54,013 --> 00:00:55,760
because the skin doesn't tear.

23
00:00:55,810 --> 00:00:56,598
Mila rolls it…

24
00:00:56,648 --> 00:00:57,067
gently!

25
00:00:57,861 --> 00:00:59,877
And that's why bubbles are round.

26
00:01:01,361 --> 00:01:04,408
The bubble's skin pulls to be as small as possible,

27
00:01:04,458 --> 00:01:06,584
and the smallest shape is the ball.

28
00:01:07,862 --> 00:01:11,088
With an adult: twist a piece of wire into a star,

29
00:01:11,138 --> 00:01:13,161
dip it in soapy water and blow.

30
00:01:13,211 --> 00:01:14,414
Is it still round?

31
00:01:15,201 --> 00:01:17,712
And how do we know dinosaurs existed?

32
00:01:17,762 --> 00:01:19,146
The answer tomorrow.
